    {
      "id": "WCwiFViXRcRUrl5ovs4HL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290.773759953847,
      "y": -969.3175206458345,
      "width": 416.25567626953125,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1659281196,
      "version": 589,
      "versionNonce": 2029677100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784722915277,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Observations:\n    5-7 job config\n    each runs once a week\n    each run takes <1day && >1hr\n        each run is essentially :\n        pushes one usercontext into MCS queue\n        wakes up when MCS returns result via webhook\n        sends result back to client via teams msg\n    availability\n    resumability\n    <5s delayed job pickup",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Observations:\n    5-7 job config\n    each runs once a week\n    each run takes <1day && >1hr\n        each run is essentially :\n        pushes one usercontext into MCS queue\n        wakes up when MCS returns result via webhook\n        sends result back to client via teams msg\n    availability\n    resumability\n    <5s delayed job pickup",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KvDEGZPxcNtO6NHOafmsP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2729.979363289513,
      "y": -961.1297526675384,
      "width": 537.7755126953125,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1743100716,
      "version": 758,
      "versionNonce": 1319848620,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784722916508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "why PAF is overkill:\n1. 0.4usd per task trigger\n2. MCS connector cost\n3. MCS enquue failure: paf provides fixes interval \n    retry, mcs has custom retry-after, which required custom\n    handling\n4. ton of guarantees given by PAf were not required for out usecase\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "why PAF is overkill:\n1. 0.4usd per task trigger\n2. MCS connector cost\n3. MCS enquue failure: paf provides fixes interval \n    retry, mcs has custom retry-after, which required custom\n    handling\n4. ton of guarantees given by PAf were not required for out usecase\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NTzhKwZl4f6iooZp1wGIF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2314.7696169982264,
      "y": -722.2345692560085,
      "width": 681.551513671875,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 136178196,
      "version": 275,
      "versionNonce": 1436721452,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784722919383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the solution:\nartifacts : azure durable function\n// Method1: Fire-and-forget dispatcher\n[FunctionName(\"DispatchUsers\")]\npublic async Task Run([TimerTrigger(\"0 0 8 * * MON\")] TimerInfo timer)\n{\n    var users = await GetUsersForJob();\n    foreach (var user in users)\n    {\n        var corrId = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n        await _db.InsertAsync(new AgentRun(corrId, user.Id, \"dispatched\"));\n        mcscorrid = await _mcsClient.PostAsync(user, corrId);  // fire, don't await result\n        await _db.UpdateAsync(new AgentRun(corrId, mcscorrid, user.Id, \"dispatched\"));\n    }\n}\n\n// Method2: Webhook — MCS calls this when done\n[FunctionName(\"McsWebhook\")]\npublic async Task Webhook([HttpTrigger] HttpRequest req)\n{\n    var payload = await req.ReadFromJsonAsync<McsResult>();\n    var run = await _db.GetAsync(payload.CorrelationId);\n    \n    await _teamsClient.SendMessageAsync(run.UserId, payload.Result);\n    run.Status = \"completed\";\n    await _db.UpdateAsync(run);\n}",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the solution:\nartifacts : azure durable function\n// Method1: Fire-and-forget dispatcher\n[FunctionName(\"DispatchUsers\")]\npublic async Task Run([TimerTrigger(\"0 0 8 * * MON\")] TimerInfo timer)\n{\n    var users = await GetUsersForJob();\n    foreach (var user in users)\n    {\n        var corrId = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n        await _db.InsertAsync(new AgentRun(corrId, user.Id, \"dispatched\"));\n        mcscorrid = await _mcsClient.PostAsync(user, corrId);  // fire, don't await result\n        await _db.UpdateAsync(new AgentRun(corrId, mcscorrid, user.Id, \"dispatched\"));\n    }\n}\n\n// Method2: Webhook — MCS calls this when done\n[FunctionName(\"McsWebhook\")]\npublic async Task Webhook([HttpTrigger] HttpRequest req)\n{\n    var payload = await req.ReadFromJsonAsync<McsResult>();\n    var run = await _db.GetAsync(payload.CorrelationId);\n    \n    await _teamsClient.SendMessageAsync(run.UserId, payload.Result);\n    run.Status = \"completed\";\n    await _db.UpdateAsync(run);\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KgaW9348L_YhUVmvfkWDV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 609.3391166584815,
      "y": 889.2568620383632,
      "width": 584.1275024414062,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1776472084,
      "version": 1213,
      "versionNonce": 784370476,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784748699180,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. PAF master flow auto runs every start of week day\n2. fetches all user, iterates over users, per user does below:\n    gets s2s token from BAP RP\n    create a corr id = usrid#ts\n    triggers MCS(RAG) with {startdate, enddate,userid,ts,s2stoken}\n    mcs returns mcscorrid \n    we add following to convstate table : {userid,mcscorrid,corrid,ts,state}\n3. rag has steps defined : \n    a. get resource assignment (RA) \n    b. ger resource booking (RB)\n    c. get existing time entries (TE)\n    d. calc intersection of (A+B) and C\n    e. get team meeting and mail info from M365 for the date range \n    f. creates comment per time entry by making a generative AI call\n    e. create time entries ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. PAF master flow auto runs every start of week day\n2. fetches all user, iterates over users, per user does below:\n    gets s2s token from BAP RP\n    create a corr id = usrid#ts\n    triggers MCS(RAG) with {startdate, enddate,userid,ts,s2stoken}\n    mcs returns mcscorrid \n    we add following to convstate table : {userid,mcscorrid,corrid,ts,state}\n3. rag has steps defined : \n    a. get resource assignment (RA) \n    b. ger resource booking (RB)\n    c. get existing time entries (TE)\n    d. calc intersection of (A+B) and C\n    e. get team meeting and mail info from M365 for the date range \n    f. creates comment per time entry by making a generative AI call\n    e. create time entries ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bEZM_1k15eZXAXI5RX3kA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6754.026528491718,
      "y": 807.8280765501122,
      "width": 585.95166015625,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 515354004,
      "version": 923,
      "versionNonce": 657272876,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784988934815,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. MCS changes :\n    instruction + knowledge change\n    put mcp server basic contract details in knowledge\n    mentioned fallback to tools if mcp fails\n    put retry in knowledge\n2. mcp server:\n    certain type of entity operation werent supported\n   we had to co dev \n    custom apis remained same\n    decision to invoke tools was still with mcs, it hallucinated\n        WHY? no of tools increased, lot of global tools\n3. Queue : consumer was dropping responses, added queue between mcs and\n    consumer",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. MCS changes :\n    instruction + knowledge change\n    put mcp server basic contract details in knowledge\n    mentioned fallback to tools if mcp fails\n    put retry in knowledge\n2. mcp server:\n    certain type of entity operation werent supported\n   we had to co dev \n    custom apis remained same\n    decision to invoke tools was still with mcs, it hallucinated\n        WHY? no of tools increased, lot of global tools\n3. Queue : consumer was dropping responses, added queue between mcs and\n    consumer",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
