      "text": "Azure Persistent  Function 1 : producer\na. gets triggered on weekstart\nb. for each user gets token from BAP RP\nc. enqueues user req (start, end, id, token)\n    into mcs\nd. gets mcs corrid\ne. writes {userid,corrid,mcscorrid,ts,state} into\n    ConvState table",
